rows.en:
I see, so you want to know.
Oh, all right.
I'll tell you.{p}

This is bad, a spirit has appeared!
Everyone, don't move!
If you move, it'll attack you!{p}

Hey, come on, you can't turn the lights on.
Who turned on the lights?
...Jeez, you've killed the mood.{p}

"Ah! There's a tape recorder sitting right here!"
She said it and pointed under the desk.
Don't tell me all those creepy sounds had been coming from this tape recorder?{p}

Whoa, there.
Why are you making that face?
{f:Cut it out.|Is something the matter?}
{f:Keep giving me funny looks like that|You're cute, so}{f: and you'll wear this beautiful face away| a smile would suit you better}.
{f:Honestly.|Hmm.}
{f:You're|All right,} {f:hopeless, you know that|I'll be frank}.
{f:You don't appreciate|I mean,} {f:the value of my secrets one bit.|I'm the school's super idol, aren't I?}
{f:Got it|You're in the newspaper club, so you must know that much}?
{f:There|So there} are tons of {f:gals|people} who idolize me and try to pry out my blood type and birthday.{p}

...Maybe he was right.
This Kazama guy was pretty good-looking, after all.
But...
If he didn't say such weird things, he'd surely be a lot cooler{f:.|.}
.........................And yet, in the end, {f:I|I} heard all sorts of things from Kazama and decided to do a feature on him.
Birthday, blood type, favorite color, favorite food, his type of girl... I got every last thing out of him.{p}
